Apple today provided public beta testers with the first releases of upcoming iOS 26.5, iPadOS 26.5, <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/macos-26/">macOS Tahoe</a> 26.5, watchOS 26.5, and tvOS 26.5 updates for testing purposes. The public betas come four days after Apple provided the betas to developers, though Apple seeded updated iOS 26.5 and iPadOS 26.5 betas to developers earlier today.<br/>
<br/>
